  <AltText>
    Pixel art of Satoki sitting on a train bound for nowhere. She is sitting alone on an empty train with blue seats, various greys for the metal that the train is built from. Fox has light skin, red hair, eyes that are closed, which implies that she might be asleep, and an orange dress. Outside is a cityscape at sunset. You can see the high rise buildings and the sky changing to orange hues due to the sunset.
